Q: When optional starts as nil, changing value doesn&#39;t work A: <p>Unfortunately <code>didSet</code> does not work with <code>@Published</code> properties. You need to monitor them like this:</p>
<pre><code>class MyViewModel: ObservableObject {

    init() {
        $things.map ...
            .assign(to: &amp;$anotherProperty)
    }
</code></pre>
